# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - EVENT 030 TIME TRAVELER SPRITES
# ============================================================================
# Decision category icons and picture, decision icons, spirit icons, the
# baseline report image and the two achievement triplets of the baseline.
# The remaining art of the package (super-event images, flag, faction emblems,
# state modifier, GUI value icons, later achievements) is installed on disk and
# is wired by the phase that uses it. See docs/events/030_time_traveler.md.
# ============================================================================

